tryLock free true
tryLock again (non-recursive) false
close locked: cannot close a locked native mutex
unlock unlocked: nativeMutexUnlock() called on an unlocked mutex
lock blocking ok
closed mutex: unknown native mutex handle
notify unheld: nativeConditionNotify() requires the calling thread to hold the mutex
wait unheld: nativeConditionWait() requires the calling thread to hold the mutex
notify held ok
notify bad mutex: unknown native mutex handle
tryWait 1 true
tryWait 2 true
tryWait 3 false
wait available ok
tryWait 4 true
closed semaphore: unknown native semaphore handle
create args: nativeMutexCreate() expects no arguments
negative initial: nativeSemaphoreCreate(initial) expects a non-negative integer
wait args: nativeConditionWait(condition, mutex) expects a condition and a mutex
